{"4264440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragon Guardians", "steam_appid": 4264440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train powerful dragons, collect rare power cards, explore dangerous worlds, and protect your village from the Dark Lord in this action-packed fantasy RPG adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAIN &amp; EVOLVE 20 UNIQUE DRAGONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and evolve over 20 dragons, each with unique elements, abilities, and fighting styles. Upgrade power, stamina, health, and speed to build the ultimate battle team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/96c97675387c457ce5fce61ad7906ce3.poster.avif?t=1786124763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/96c97675387c457ce5fce61ad7906ce3.webm?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/96c97675387c457ce5fce61ad7906ce3.mp4?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE POWER CARD SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dozens of power cards and combine them to create your own combat strategy. Use magical boosts, attacks, and abilities to dominate missions and boss battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEED YOUR DRAGON &amp; KEEP IT STRONG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the market and feed your dragons with meat, fish, fruit, and magical foods. A well-fed dragon fights faster, hits harder, and survives longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/7026a37d17f6fc1c30ff8881b62b643c.poster.avif?t=1786124763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/7026a37d17f6fc1c30ff8881b62b643c.webm?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/7026a37d17f6fc1c30ff8881b62b643c.mp4?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EPIC BATTLES &amp; BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through challenging missions filled with elite creatures, enemy waves, environmental hazards, and dangerous bosses. Use skills, cards, and ultimate attacks to win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE YOUR DRAGON CAVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and customize your own dragon cave with chests, torches, rugs, and magical items. Make it your dragon’s true home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/c68211603fcc04d7f35095a24930d6dd.poster.avif?t=1786124763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/c68211603fcc04d7f35095a24930d6dd.webm?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/c68211603fcc04d7f35095a24930d6dd.mp4?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN MINI-GAMES FOR EXTRA REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play additional game modes including Runner challenges, Puzzle mini-games and Catapult shooter missions. Earn rewards to grow stronger and upgrade your dragons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR VILLAGE FROM THE DARK LORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Lord is spreading his army across the land. Train your dragons, strengthen your cards, and protect your village from destruction.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train powerful dragons, collect rare power cards, explore dangerous worlds, and protect your village from the Dark Lord in this action-packed fantasy RPG adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAIN &amp; EVOLVE 20 UNIQUE DRAGONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and evolve over 20 dragons, each with unique elements, abilities, and fighting styles. Upgrade power, stamina, health, and speed to build the ultimate battle team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/96c97675387c457ce5fce61ad7906ce3.poster.avif?t=1786124763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/96c97675387c457ce5fce61ad7906ce3.webm?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/96c97675387c457ce5fce61ad7906ce3.mp4?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE POWER CARD SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dozens of power cards and combine them to create your own combat strategy. Use magical boosts, attacks, and abilities to dominate missions and boss battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEED YOUR DRAGON &amp; KEEP IT STRONG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the market and feed your dragons with meat, fish, fruit, and magical foods. A well-fed dragon fights faster, hits harder, and survives longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/7026a37d17f6fc1c30ff8881b62b643c.poster.avif?t=1786124763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/7026a37d17f6fc1c30ff8881b62b643c.webm?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/7026a37d17f6fc1c30ff8881b62b643c.mp4?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EPIC BATTLES &amp; BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through challenging missions filled with elite creatures, enemy waves, environmental hazards, and dangerous bosses. Use skills, cards, and ultimate attacks to win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE YOUR DRAGON CAVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and customize your own dragon cave with chests, torches, rugs, and magical items. Make it your dragon’s true home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/c68211603fcc04d7f35095a24930d6dd.poster.avif?t=1786124763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/c68211603fcc04d7f35095a24930d6dd.webm?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/extras/c68211603fcc04d7f35095a24930d6dd.mp4?t=1786124763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN MINI-GAMES FOR EXTRA REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play additional game modes including Runner challenges, Puzzle mini-games and Catapult shooter missions. Earn rewards to grow stronger and upgrade your dragons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR VILLAGE FROM THE DARK LORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Lord is spreading his army across the land. Train your dragons, strengthen your cards, and protect your village from destruction.</p>", "short_description": "Evolve your dragons, build your cave, collect rare power cards, and defeat powerful bosses across dangerous lands. Grow stronger with every battle!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/a57a0410f91b6663b45cf86b09f164a3a7ab862d/header.jpg?t=1786124763", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/0500a54dce2e9fcc242a0f90a5e2a6dbed403137/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786124763", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264440/0500a54dce2e9fcc242a0f90a5e2a6dbed403137/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786124763", "website": "https://queendeveloper.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><str